Subject: [PATCH 07739/11362] [outer-loop] ARC gap: add 5840 live-search
 boundary + prior-art correction (world-model rollout already built)

The 5840 gap entry was missing (a LIVE/live case mismatch made the earlier insert a
no-op). Added: live search reaches tu93 L1, deep blocked by non-idempotent reset; and
the prior-art correction -- the 'open problems' I named (world-model rollout / parity-
aware live search) are E3's already-built plan_in_model + executable/nav world model,
which already found the same tu93-L1 ceiling. Real bottleneck = dynamics-induction
quality (heldout ~0.0), a known standing problem.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
